{"term": {"label": "性", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "4B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/li-lou-ii", "title": "離婁下", "description": "孟子曰：「舜生於諸馮，遷於負夏，卒於鳴條，東夷之人也。文王生於岐周，卒於畢郢，西夷之人也。地之相去也，千有餘里；世之相後也，千有餘歲。得志行乎中國，若合符節。先聖後聖，其揆一也。」\n子產聽鄭國之政，以其乘輿濟人於溱洧。孟子曰：「惠而不知為政。歲十一月徒杠成，十二月輿梁成，民未病涉也。君子平其政，行辟人可也。焉得人人而濟", "occurrences": 1, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "右師", "id": "右師"}, {"form": "君子", "id": "君子"}, {"form": "善", "id": "善"}, {"form": "大人", "id": "大人"}, {"form": "天下", "id": "天下"}, {"form": "好", "id": "好"}, {"form": "後", "id": "後"}, {"form": "心", "id": "心"}, {"form": "思", "id": "思"}, {"form": "性", "variants": [], "id": "性"}, {"form": "惡", "id": "惡"}, {"form": "服", "id": "服"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "聽", "id": "聽"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}, {"form": "言", "id": "言"}, {"form": "酒", "id": "酒"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.203378442910598, "source": "王", "target": "天下"}, {"weight": 2.203378442910598, "source": "王", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 2.3856999997045523, "source": "王", "target": "服"}, {"weight": 2.0027077474484467, "source": "大人", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 2.608843551018762, "source": "大人", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 1.7615456906315583, "source": "酒", "target": "善"}, {"weight": 3.3019907315787074, "source": "酒", "target": "好"}, {"weight": 2.608843551018762, "source": "酒", "target": "惡"}, {"weight": 1.309560566888501, "source": "酒", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 2.321161478566981, "source": "酒", "target": "後"}, {"weight": 1.7979133348024332, "source": "行", "target": "聽"}, {"weight": 0.4986303506721724, "source": "行", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 1.5102312623506524, "source": "行", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 0.2109482782203915, "source": "君子", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 1.5102312623506524, "source": "君子", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 1.2225491898988714, "source": "天下", "target": "後"}, {"weight": 2.3856999997045523, "source": "天下", "target": "服"}, {"weight": 1.5102312623506524